| fixture.rb:13:45:13:67 | call to protected_ref? | Cache protection tier determined by `pipeline.protected_ref?` (a branch property) rather than the user's actual role. A developer running a job on a protected branch receives the maintainer-tier cache, enabling cache poisoning across privilege boundaries. Use `project.team.max_member_access(user.id) >= Gitlab::Access::MAINTAINER` instead. |
